### PerpusMini API — buka dengan ekstensi "REST Client" (VS Code)
@host = http://localhost:3000
@token = isi_token_hasil_login

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Daftar endpoint
GET {{host}}/api

### ---------- AUTH ----------
### Registrasi anggota baru
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Kadek Mahasiswa",
  "email": "kadek@perpusmini.test",
  "password": "Rahasia123",
  "konfirmasi_password": "Rahasia123",
  "no_telp": "081338889999"
}

### Login (salin token dari respons ke variabel @token di atas)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@perpusmini.test",
  "password": "Admin1234"
}

### Profil saya
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- KATEGORI ----------
GET {{host}}/api/kategori?page=1&limit=10&sort=nama
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/kategori/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/kategori
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Kecerdasan Buatan",
  "deskripsi": "Machine learning, deep learning, dan penerapannya"
}

###
PUT {{host}}/api/kategori/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deskripsi": "Buku pemrograman berbagai bahasa"
}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/kategori/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- BUKU ----------
GET {{host}}/api/buku?page=1&limit=10&q=node&sort=judul
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
GET {{host}}/api/buku/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/buku
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kategori_id": 1,
  "judul": "REST API dengan Express",
  "penulis": "Gede Pratama",
  "isbn": "9786020000012",
  "tahun_terbit": 2025,
  "stok": 4,
  "sinopsis": "Panduan membangun REST API yang aman."
}

###
PUT {{host}}/api/buku/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stok": 10
}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/buku/6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- PEMINJAMAN ----------
GET {{host}}/api/peminjaman?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{host}}/api/peminjaman
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "buku_id": 1,
  "user_id": 2,
  "catatan": "Pinjam untuk tugas akhir"
}

### Pengembalian buku
PUT {{host}}/api/peminjaman/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "dikembalikan"
}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/peminjaman/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- USERS (admin) ----------
GET {{host}}/api/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
PUT {{host}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nama": "Wayan Anggota Perpustakaan",
  "is_active": true
}

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- UJI KEAMANAN ----------
### SQL Injection pada login (harus gagal)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@perpusmini.test' OR '1'='1",
  "password": "apa saja"
}

### Stored XSS pada judul (tag harus dibuang)
POST {{host}}/api/buku
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "kategori_id": 1,
  "judul": "<script>alert('xss')</script>Buku Aman",
  "penulis": "<img src=x onerror=alert(1)>Budi",
  "isbn": "9786020000013",
  "tahun_terbit": 2024,
  "stok": 1
}
